 N\">\\(\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathbb N,g}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是下式定义的外部真谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathbb N,g}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\ \\bigl(n=g(\\sigma)\\land\\mathbb N_A\\models_{L_A}\\sigma\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathbb N,g}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\ \\bigl(n=g(\\sigma)\\land\\mathbb N_A\\models_{L_A}\\sigma\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is a metalinguistic truth set relative to the standard structure and a numbering; it does not claim object-language definability.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"97e929795d778cd6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"e5654af7c954e1c0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"bc53ba723358facc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"97e929795d778cd6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","